    type: ["Daily claim"],
    date: "2026-03-13",
    terms: "THE PROMOTION. By entering the Promotion page, you agree to enroll as a member of the Promotion (\"Member\"). In the Promotion, a Member can earn points (\"Temu Coins\", \"Tcoins\", \"Temu Coin\", or similar) both from orders placed across the Temu platform (\"Qualifying Orders\") and from the daily check-in on the Promotion page. More exclusions may apply from time to time. Temu Coins can only be redeemed for certain free products (\"Prizes\") and discounted products (\"Temu Coin-Eligible Products\") within this Promotion. In addition, daily check-ins may offer Members a chance to claim free items (\"Gifts\"). \"Temu Coin-Eligible Products\", \"Prizes\" and \"Gifts\" are collectively defined as \"Rewards\".\n\nFor Qualifying Orders, Members will receive $0.1 Temu Coin for every US$1 spent. Temu Coins earned from Qualifying Orders placed on the Promotion page will be credited instantly after the Member clicks the \"Claim\" button that appears immediately following a successful checkout. Temu Coins earned from Qualifying Orders placed outside the Promotion page will be credited instantly when the Member visits the Promotion page and clicks the \"Claim\" button, which credits coins for all such orders at once. Uncredited or unclaimed Temu Coins must be claimed within 24 hours of being earned, or they will expire. Members can earn up to $100 Temu Coins per day from orders. Should an order cause a Member to exceed the daily $100 Temu Coin limit, the number of Temu Coins awarded will be automatically adjusted downward to bring the day's total to precisely $100 Temu Coins.\n\nThrough daily check-ins and without using Temu Coins, Members may get a chance for designated free promotional products (\"Gifts\"). To claim a Gift, a Member must place an order that meets the minimum spending requirement with the Gift within 24 hours of selecting the Gift. Otherwise, the Gift will expire. Any Gifts that have already been claimed during previous sign-up cycles will not be available for claiming again in any future cycles. Further, the Member will earn a specified quantity of Temu Coins (as determined by Temu in its sole discretion) by daily check-in on the Promotion page. The Temu Coins earned through the daily check-in will be automatically credited to the Member's account instantly upon clicking the \"Check-in\" button. Members may receive an elevated number of Temu Coins or other additional benefits through consecutive check-ins. The Member's consecutive check-in progress will reset to Day 1 if the Member fails to complete the daily check-in on any calendar day.\n\nAll credited Temu Coins will expire at 23:59:59, thirty (30) days after the date they were credited to the account.\n\nMembers may use a specified quantity of Temu Coins as shown on the Promotion page to redeem a designated promotional item (\"Prize\") on the Promotion page. Members must place an order with the Prize item on the Promotion page within 24 hours of selecting the Prize item to claim it (minimum order amount requirements apply). If the Member does not place the qualifying order within 24 hours, the Prize will expire and the Temu Coins used for the Prize will not be refunded. If the Member cancels or returns the order containing the Prize, the Temu Coins will be refunded. Available Prizes will be refreshed periodically. Each Member is limited to redeeming only one Prize per day, but Members may repeat this process for multiple Prizes on different days. The Prize will be re-selected if the chosen Prize is out of stock or unavailable for delivery.\n\nMembers may redeem their Temu Coins for a discount on eligible products listed on the Promotion page (\"Temu Coin-Eligible Products\"). The discount shall be calculated at a rate of US$1.00 off for every ten (10) Temu Coins used, subject to the following limitations: (a) the maximum discount attainable on each Temu Coin-Eligible Product shall not exceed US$50; (b) the maximum discount rate applied to each Temu Coin-Eligible Product shall not exceed 20% of its reference price. The calculated number of Temu Coins is always rounded up to the nearest whole Temu Coin. The special pricing for Temu Coin-Eligible Products is a standalone offer and not stackable with any other promotional offers unless otherwise permitted.\n\nTemu Coins cannot be transferred, cashed out, or used outside this Promotion. Cancellation or return of any order that has earned Temu Coins may lead to the revocation of Temu Coins or Reward(s). The number of Temu Coins to be revoked will be calculated based on the refund amount and will not exceed the number of Temu Coins that the Member has received from the order, which may have been reduced due to daily limits.\n\nMinimum order amount requirements will apply. Shipping fees may apply.\n\nTIME LIMIT. The Promotion runs until it is terminated, canceled, or suspended by Sponsor in its sole discretion.",
